WEBVTT

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:31.980
Good morning!

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:33.100
Morning.

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:33.910
Morning.

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:36.980
Seriously? Are you okay?

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:39.740
That happened in your room?

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:54.240
It's a good thing Tomoyo-chan 
had that needle...

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:57.620
I'm only glad I could be of help.

00:01:57.620 --> 00:01:58.290
And...

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:03.060
This time, I was able to capture 
your heroism on video!

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:06.750
Your smile and the peace sign 
when you captured the card.

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:08.370
They were perfect!

00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:09.420
And...

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:13.860
<b>Wonderful!</b>

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:18.610
Next time, I'll finally get 
to see your new pose...

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.110
<b>Wonderful!</b>

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:18.610
<b>Oh ho ho ho!</b>

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:20.810
I'm so excited!

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:29.120
<b>Sakura's Heavy Rain Alert</b>

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:32.760
The card turned out to be clear again.

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:34.410
Same as the others.

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:38.220
I'm carrying the key and 
cards with me, for now.

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:39.540
And the Sakura Cards?

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:40.550
They're at home.

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:43.250
The pictures are still gone, 
and I can't use them.

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:45.310
I see.

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:48.640
Kero-chan is staying home for me today, too.

00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:53.270
I told him to call me if anything 
happens in my room again.

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:56.330
I'd better get to class...

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:58.260
Morita-sensei is always early.

00:02:58.260 --> 00:02:59.540
See you later.

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:03.800
I brought the cheesecake that 
Sakura-chan and I made together.

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:05.100
Please have some at lunchtime.

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:06.620
Thanks.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:17.090
<i>So, it happened in her room...</i>

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:20.020
Morning!

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:21.670
Morning, Chiharu-chan.

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:22.710
Good morning.

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:25.510
Thanks for the cheesecake recipe.

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:27.040
It came out really good!

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:27.880
Glad to hear it.

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:30.010
We brought some for everyone!

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:32.260
I can't wait to try it!

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:35.230
Good morning.

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:37.410
Take your seats, everyone!

00:03:37.410 --> 00:03:39.100
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:47.410
Oh, it's raining?

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:50.560
But today's chance of precipitation was 0%...

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:52.910
What will I do about an umbrella?

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:56.350
Sakura-chan, did you bring an umbrella?

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:58.730
I put a folding one in my bag.

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:00.480
Oh, that's good.

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:01.510
Now, for today's announcements.

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:03.620
I hope it stops by lunchtime.

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:05.300
We'll be discussing the spring 
field trip, as well as special lessons.

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:07.490
Yeah, it'd be nice to eat 
outside with everyone.

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:11.040
Did you pack a lunch today?

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:12.600
I'm so hungry.

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:14.280
I'm eating cafeteria food. My mom overslept.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.690
You made all that yourself, Li-kun?

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:17.870
Yeah.

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:19.480
That's amazing!

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:21.310
So you're a boy who can cook.

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:23.560
No, it's just yesterday's leftovers.

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:26.650
Which means you make your own dinner, too?

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:28.290
That's even more amazing!

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:30.010
Nah, it's really not...

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:36.780
It's raining even harder now.

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:38.440
It's not stopping...

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:40.720
It keeps coming down harder.

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:42.710
Speaking of rain,

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:46.260
The Japanese for "rain" and "candy" 
both sound like "ame."

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:49.200
In ancient Egypt, rain tasted sweet,

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:52.730
so they'd catch it on plates and harden it.

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:54.380
That's why the two names sound so similar.

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:56.570
Yeah, that one is pretty far-fetched.

00:04:56.570 --> 00:04:59.570
Why would Egypt be the 
origin of Japanese words?

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:02.740
Well, an Egyptian papyrus scroll 
drifted right to Japan.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.350
That's even more far-fetched.

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:06.770
But there are some here who believe it.

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:08.780
Wow!

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:12.270
Doesn't seeing those two 
make you feel bad at all?

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:14.490
By the way...

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:17.880
Yamazaki-kun, did you end up 
joining the Lacrosse Club?

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:21.530
Yeah. It was hard to decide between 
that and the Performing Arts Club.

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:24.600
The Performing Arts Club would suit you, too.

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:25.670
Thanks!

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:27.680
That was a compliment?

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.210
How's the Drama Club going?

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:30.410
I think it'll be fun!

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:32.590
It seems like it's mostly girls, though.

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:36.960
And the story I'm thinking of now 
has a lot of male characters.

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:39.290
Do girls ever play boys?

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:41.410
It happens sometimes, apparently.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:43.400
Reversing boy and girl roles...

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.670
That brings back memories.

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:51.020
I remember when Sakura-chan was a prince,

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:54.220
and Li-kun was a princess.

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:00.770
I played a big role, too. Right?

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:01.490
Huh?

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:03.940
Y-Yeah... Your acting was good.

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:04.530
Huh?

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:05.850
It really was great.

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:06.290
Huh?

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:08.970
Oh, how could this be?

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:11.790
The princess has fallen to the witch's curse!

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:14.630
Is my memory failing me?

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:18.100
If you're short on boys, just let me know.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:21.000
I'd like to see you play a female role again!

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.290
Uh, even though there are more girls?

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:26.080
Does the Cheerleading Club start today?

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:27.060
Yeah.

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:29.840
I hope it stops raining by then...

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:34.060
Now, let's pick up from last week

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:36.830
<b>Science Lab</b>

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.830
with our study of flower observation.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:40.500
I explained how to observe 
them with a loupe, right?

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:47.590
<b>Using a loupe to observe flowers! 

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.720
By the way, this is a single 
dandelion flower.

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:48.340
A bunch of them together on one stalk 
form the "dandelion" as we know it.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:52.180
A loupe is not a magnifying glass, 
so hold it close to your eye.

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:54.810
And never look at the sun through it.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:57.490
After you're done observing, 
you'll draw pictures!

00:06:57.490 --> 00:07:01.690
Pictures, huh... I'm not really 
good at drawing flowers.

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:04.920
Just observe it closely, and you 
won't have any trouble.

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:05.900
I'll try!

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:09.240
<b>Sakura-chan!</b>

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:11.120
What's the matter?

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:13.160
I think Naoko-chan did this.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:15.560
I lent her my textbook, a while ago.

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:17.470
Oh, how cute!

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:23.530
Even in illustrations, you two are so close!

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:30.980
What's the problem, Kinomoto?

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.550
S-Sorry...

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:42.940
It really did keep raining all day.

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:45.800
And it was supposed to be 
your club's first day...

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:48.510
Well, at least I got my 
application turned in.

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:50.230
I'll work hard in middle school, too.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:55.840
Let me know when the Chorus Club 
has recitals or competitions, okay?

00:07:56.210 --> 00:07:57.590
Of course.

00:07:58.050 --> 00:08:02.370
It's too bad Li-kun couldn't 
walk home with us today.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:03.400
Yeah...

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:11.840
Over there!

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:13.520
Let's take shelter here!

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:14.330
Okay!

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:16.420
We can't get home in this!

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:22.070
It's raining so hard...

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:24.440
I can't see in front of me at all.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:27.030
It's like a waterfall.

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:36.920
Sakura-chan, this rain...

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:38.600
Could it be...

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:42.910
The key is shining?

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:45.630
Then, it must be...

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:53.340
Why do you have a costume?

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:56.300
I thought I'd add the finishing 
touches during our break.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:58.930
I'm so glad I brought it to school!

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:03.230
Now, let's see the new pose 
you practiced yesterday.

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:04.430
O-Okay.

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:10.320
<i>Key that hides the forces of dreams!</i>

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:14.990
<i>Show me your true form!</i>

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:18.000
<i>Release!</i>

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:41.090
It's too wonderful!

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:55.800
Sakura-chan!

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:00.320
<i>The water...</i>

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:03.460
<i>If it reaches my face, I won't 
be able to breathe...</i>

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:08.160
Tomoyo-chan!

00:10:11.030 --> 00:10:14.730
<i>There must be something 
controlling this water...</i>

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:16.830
<i>There must be!</i>

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:20.530
<i>Gale!</i>

00:10:32.620 --> 00:10:33.720
Over there!

00:10:38.420 --> 00:10:40.890
Enclose the source of this water!

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:43.140
<i>Siege!</i>

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:55.170
<i>Force without master,</i>

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:59.010
<i>heed the call of my Staff of Dreams, 
and become my power!</i>

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:02.500
<i>Secure!</i>

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:20.990
<b>Water's Source</b>

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:22.110
"Water's source"...

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:24.620
Aqua.

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:29.000
Tomoyo-chan!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:33.570
I wasn't able to film your 
heroism, Sakura-chan!

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:37.140
Your camcorder's wet! Is it okay?

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:39.900
I thought something like this might happen,

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:46.010
so I had the Daidouji Toys development 
team apply cutting-edge waterproofing!

00:11:56.390 --> 00:11:58.030
<i>That sounds just like Daidouji.</i>

00:11:58.280 --> 00:11:59.690
She said that, next time,

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:03.280
she'll have them develop a way to make 
sure she doesn't drop the camcorder.

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:06.330
<b>Syaoran-kun</b>

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:06.330
<b>

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:06.320
<i>Anyway, I'm glad neither of you were hurt.</i>

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:08.500
Yeah.

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:11.220
<i>There's no telling what'll happen now.</i>

00:12:11.220 --> 00:12:12.450
<i>Be careful.</i>

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:15.070
I will. Thanks.

00:12:15.070 --> 00:12:16.850
<i>Okay, see you tomorrow.</i>

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:18.080
See you tomorrow.

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:18.750
<b>

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:19.340
<b>Syaoran-kun</b>

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:19.340
<b>

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:22.220
Y'all really had a rough time, huh?

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:25.860
I'm glad I was able to take care 
of it with the two cards I had.

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:28.440
Nothing happened here at home?

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:32.620
Nope! I beat the dungeon in 
three tries, but that's about it!

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:34.260
Were you actually keeping watch?

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:38.770
How rude! It's only because I'm so 
amazing that I beat it in three tries!

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:41.260
It would've taken Spinny at least five tries!

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:45.340
I watched you play a game with 
Spinel-san online, a while ago,

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:48.320
and as I recall, he was better than you...

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:51.530
Hey! You're only attackin' me! Quit it! No!

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:54.800
Spinny, help me! Use your healing magic!

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:58.400
I'm pretty sure Spinel-san was helping you.

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:02.150
You're just rememberin' it wrong. 
It happens all the time.

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:08.210
Anyway, that rain really soaked you good.

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:12.290
Better warm up, so you don't catch a cold.

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:13.250
Okay.

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:17.490
Oh, right... I need to make 
dinner for Onii-chan.

00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:19.470
He's gonna be late again, today?

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:20.190
Yeah.

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:23.910
He sure is busy, with school and 
part-time jobs, every day.

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:27.770
I hope <i>he</i> doesn't catch a cold.

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:29.280
<b>Western Sweets  Tirol</b>

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:30.980
Are you all right?

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:33.230
This is no cold.

00:13:33.230 --> 00:13:35.130
Someone's talking about me.

00:13:35.430 --> 00:13:37.970
All good things, I'm sure.

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:45.130
<b>Sakura-chan</b>

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:45.130
<b>Something strange happened again... 
I got another card...</b>

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:48.200
Is it from Sakura?

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:52.220
I bet she's gotten into some 
weird mess again.

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:53.380
How did you...

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:59.230
You both wear your emotions 
all over your faces.

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:02.210
T-Toya!

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:06.090
Also...

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:10.860
The power I gave you guys 
will never come back.

00:14:12.230 --> 00:14:15.710
But I think I've discovered 
something else I can do.

00:14:16.110 --> 00:14:17.350
Really?

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:19.320
You don't fall asleep all the 
time anymore, right?

00:14:19.870 --> 00:14:21.530
No, I don't, but...

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.200
What is it you can do?

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:26.050
Toya, it isn't something you 
don't want to do, is it?

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:32.110
Hurry up and change, so we can go home.

00:14:32.110 --> 00:14:33.420
Toya...

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.970
Hang on. I'll get my stuff now.

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:42.050
You'll find out when the time comes.

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:46.220
They're already assembled.

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:47.230
Where's our club room, again?

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:47.240
We'd better hurry.

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:04.960
I can tell you came from Tomoeda 
Elementary's Cheerleading Club!

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:07.220
Perfect success, Sakura-chan!

00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:09.220
All because of you, Chiharu-chan.

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:13.390
This should be an exciting year, 
with all our experienced first-years.

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:16.560
Of course, we'll work hard 
with all the first-timers, too!

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:17.430
Yes, ma'am!

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:19.220
That'll be all for today!

00:15:19.220 --> 00:15:23.060
Next time we practice, I'll hand 
out your new uniforms.

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:26.640
Good work, everyone.

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:28.780
Thank you, ma'am!

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:32.250
I wonder what color the uniforms will be!

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:32.250
Do your hands hurt?

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:33.960
I'm so thirsty!

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:33.700
Not at all.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:36.050
I can't wait to see the new uniforms!

00:15:36.050 --> 00:15:38.060
Yeah! I wonder what they'll be like.

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:42.130
What's wrong?

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:45.590
My shoe's untied. You can go on ahead.

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:46.450
Okay.

00:15:49.870 --> 00:15:51.510
There, we go!

00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:56.720
Huh?

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:01.410
Everyone's gone...

00:16:02.780 --> 00:16:04.160
Could it be?

00:16:05.870 --> 00:16:09.620
Did a new card make everyone disappear?

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:12.250
In that case...

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:14.090
<i>Release!</i>

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:25.380
Nothing's... happening.

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:29.020
But there's still no one around.

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:33.350
It has to be the work of a card.

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:36.050
I'll just try one.

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:39.510
I'm not sure what I should try 
to enclose with Siege, so...

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:40.600
Yeah.

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:42.740
I'll keep the power low.

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:44.920
<i>Gale!</i>

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:54.390
It hit something?

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:55.920
One more time!

00:16:56.730 --> 00:16:57.660
<i>Gale!</i>

00:17:03.240 --> 00:17:04.700
Huh?

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:08.130
<i>It's on the move?</i>

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:12.090
<i>Gale!</i>

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.350
<i>It's definitely moving!</i>

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:27.020
<i>Gale!</i>

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:29.070
<i>Gale!</i>

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:31.110
<i>Gale!</i>

00:17:31.640 --> 00:17:32.360
<i>Gale!</i>

00:17:42.930 --> 00:17:45.840
It's no use. It keeps moving.

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:47.660
I can't tell where it is.

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:49.590
And it's nearly invisible...

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:56.080
Maybe magic on a larger scale would...

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:05.170
<i>Show me the location of that which is hidden!</i>

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:07.620
<i>Aqua!</i>

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:21.190
There it is!

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:23.700
<i>Force without master,</i>

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:27.790
<i>heed the call of my Staff of Dreams, 
and become my power!</i>

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:31.140
<i>Secure!</i>

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:48.140
<b>Reflection</b>

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:47.570
Reflection.

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:52.870
Reflect.

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:56.950
So that's how it reflected my magic.

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:08.890
I'm soaked again...

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:09.700
Sakura!

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:14.170
Are you all right?

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:15.590
Y-Yeah.

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:18.050
There was another new card...

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:19.460
Hey, why's the ground so wet?

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:22.300
It's still this wet from yesterday's rain?

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.920
Glad we didn't have a match today...

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:30.120
You should change before you catch a cold.

00:19:36.310 --> 00:19:37.240
Okay.

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:48.080
I'm home!

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:50.280
Welcome home, Sakura-san.

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:53.690
Thanks. Hey, can I use the washing machine?

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:56.320
Of course, but why?

00:19:56.690 --> 00:19:58.640
My PE uniform got wet.

00:19:58.640 --> 00:20:01.350
Really? Did it rain today?

00:20:01.350 --> 00:20:05.350
No, but it got splashed when 
I was tossing out water.

00:20:05.650 --> 00:20:06.700
Are you okay?

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:08.460
I changed right away.

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:10.990
There's still some time until dinner.

00:20:10.990 --> 00:20:13.280
You should hop in the bath, first.

00:20:13.280 --> 00:20:14.290
I'll do that.

00:20:14.290 --> 00:20:16.510
I'm making a cabbage roll today.

00:20:16.510 --> 00:20:18.050
And chicken rice.

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:21.480
When I'm done with my bath, I'll help you.

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:23.870
Thanks, but don't worry about me.

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:26.050
Take your time getting warmed up.

00:20:26.380 --> 00:20:27.330
Okay!

00:20:28.650 --> 00:20:29.970
I'm home, Kero-chan.

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:31.440
Welcome home!

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:34.180
Hi-yah! Hi-yah! Hi-yah! Hi-yah! 
Take that and that and that!

00:20:34.180 --> 00:20:36.550
And... There!

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:38.310
D'oh...

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:41.980
What's up, Sakura? Goin' somewhere?

00:20:42.770 --> 00:20:44.710
Just to take my bath.

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:46.460
Want to join—

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:51.470
What's wrong, Sakura?

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:54.480
H-Huh?

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:56.910
Sakura? Hey, Sakura!

00:20:56.910 --> 00:20:57.910
Sakura!

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:25.980
You again?

00:21:27.710 --> 00:21:29.610
Who are you?

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:35.010
Is this a dream? Or...

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:44.350
No!

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:47.210
You can't go!

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:51.120
No!

00:21:54.610 --> 00:21:55.870
No!

00:21:57.030 --> 00:21:58.130
No!

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:03.800
You're...

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:05.090
Sakura!

00:22:09.920 --> 00:22:11.120
Did I...

00:22:11.120 --> 00:22:14.090
You suddenly fell over! Scared me to death!

00:22:14.380 --> 00:22:16.090
Does it hurt anywhere?

00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:18.580
That person was...

00:22:18.580 --> 00:22:19.800
Sakura?

00:22:21.050 --> 00:22:27.700
...almost the same height... as me.

00:24:10.460 --> 00:24:12.310
Hidey-howdy-ho!

00:24:11.590 --> 00:24:12.970
<b>Leave It to Kero-chan!</b>

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:20.480
<b>K</b>

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:20.480
<b>Bear      Cat</b>

00:24:13.210 --> 00:24:15.850
We're back for another 
"Leave It to Kero-chan!"

00:24:15.850 --> 00:24:17.860
Today, I'm introducing this!

00:24:17.860 --> 00:24:20.710
The battle costume Tomoyo made!

00:24:20.710 --> 00:24:25.400
It's fully waterproof, with a frog motif, 
and it even comes with boots.

00:24:25.400 --> 00:24:28.510
I couldn't introduce her ribboned costume 
last week, but it was also great.

00:24:28.510 --> 00:24:31.160
Tomoyo's costumes really are 
just the thing for Sakura.

00:24:31.160 --> 00:24:33.000
I wish she'd make me one, too...

00:24:31.990 --> 00:24:32.990
<b>Not necessary! 
No one wants to see that!!</b>

00:24:32.990 --> 00:24:37.660
<b>Bear      Cat</b>

00:24:32.990 --> 00:24:37.660
<b>K</b>

00:24:33.220 --> 00:24:35.760
Anyway, I wonder how many 
Clear Cards there are.

00:24:35.760 --> 00:24:38.370
From now on, look forward to seeing 
how Sakura takes care of business!

00:24:38.370 --> 00:24:39.990
Ta-ta!

00:24:40.000 --> 00:24:41.750
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:24:40.310 --> 00:24:42.130
Our class has a new transfer student.

00:24:42.440 --> 00:24:44.610
Her name's Akiho Shinomoto-chan,

00:24:44.610 --> 00:24:47.160
and I invited her to eat lunch with us.

00:24:47.160 --> 00:24:49.210
I hope we can become friends!

00:24:49.210 --> 00:24:55.010
<b>Sakura and the Lovely Transfer Student</b>

00:24:49.480 --> 00:24:52.150
Next time, "Sakura and the 
Lovely Transfer Student."

00:24:52.150 --> 00:24:55.010
Say it with me: "Release!"

00:24:55.010 --> 00:25:00.010
<b>End</b>
